        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-64" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 41px;&quot;&gt;쇼핑몰 소프트웨어 구성도&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="155" y="26" width="1120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-65" value="1. Media Server&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할 :&amp;nbsp;정적 미디어 파일(이미지, 영상)서비스 및 비동기 기반 미디어 API 제공&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&amp;nbsp;선정이유&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Nginx는 고성능 정적 파일 처리에 강함&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - FastAPI+Uvicorn은 빠른 비동기 처리로 미디어 API에 적합, 경량 서버 구성&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="5" y="560" width="190" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-66" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" edge="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1" source="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-65" target="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-65">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-67" value="&lt;div&gt;2. Web Server&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ● 역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp; 정적 웹 페이지 서비스&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp; HTTPS 인증서 자동 갱신&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp; 웹 방화벽&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - 성능 모니터링&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&amp;nbsp;선정 이유&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Nginx는 고성능 웹 서버&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - SSL/TLS 자동화 및 보안 정책 적용 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="210" y="560" width="190" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-68" value="4. WAS Server&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 핵심 비즈니스 로직 처리&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;(회원가입, 주문, 결제 등)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 세션 및 트랜잭션 관리&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&amp;nbsp;선정 이유&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 강력한 보안 프레임워크(Spring Security)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 확장성/유지보수 용이한 Java기반&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="632.5" y="560" width="190" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-69" value="5. DB서버&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 주요 데이터 저장소(회원, 주문, 리뷰 등)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 복제/장애 전환 지원&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;선정 이유&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 오픈 소스 RDBMS 중 고가용성과 안정성 우수&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Patroni로 Master-Replica 구성 가&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="838.5" y="560" width="190" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-70" value="6. 백업 서버&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp; DB 및 파일 백업 수행&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 스케줄 기반 정기 백업 자동화&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 백업 이력 확인 및 복구 지원&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;선정 이유&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Bacula : 신뢰성 높은 백업 솔루션으로 다양한 시스템 백업 가능&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Cron : OS 내장 스케줄러를 활용하여 자동 실행 가능&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Bacula Web : 백업 결과를 UI로 시각화하고, 상태 관리 및 복구 편의성 향상&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1038.5" y="560" width="190" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-71" value="7. 모니터링 서버&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 서버 및 네트워크 자원 실시간 모니터링&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 장애 발생 시 실시간 알림 전송&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 시각화 기반 운영 대시보드 제공&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 스위치/라우터 등 네트워크 장비 상태 수집(SNMP)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;선정 이유&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Zabbix : 안정적인 모니터링 및 에이전트 기반 수집 구조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Grafana : 직관적인 시각화 대시보드 제공&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Alert Webhook : 즉시 알림 전송으로 운영 대응력 향상&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- SNMP : 네트워크 장비까지 통합 모니터링 가능&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1238.5" y="560" width="231.5" height="231.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-72" value="8. 캐시 서버&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 세션 유지, 장바구니, 인기상품 등 캐시 처리&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 고속 In-memory 데이터 서비스 제공&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 장애 발생 시 자동 전환(Failover)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;선정 이유&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Redis : 빠른 처리 속도와 간단한 구조로 캐시 용도에 적합&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Sentinel : 장애 발생 시 자동 Master 전환 가능(HA 구성)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Exporter : Prometheus 기반 상태 수집 및 시각화 연동 가능&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="560" width="230" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JRg1q9yLdb3SoABxi6JE-83" value="3. API 서버&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; ● 역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- REST API 처리(회원, 상품, 주문 등)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 외부 API 연동(PG사, 배송사, SNS등)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 인증/인가 처리&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; ● 선정 이유&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 무상태 기반 수평 확장 가능&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 인증/연계 중심 로직에 특화&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%223.%20WAS%20Server%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20-%20%EC%97%AD%ED%95%A0%20%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%EB%8F%99%EC%A0%81%20%EC%9B%B9%20%EC%95%A0%ED%94%8C%EB%A6%AC%EC%BC%80%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98%2C%20API%20%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84%2C%20%EB%B3%B4%EC%95%88%20%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20-%20%EC%84%A0%EC%A0%95%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%9C%A0%20%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3BNode.js%EB%8A%94%20%EB%B9%A0%EB%A5%B8%20I%2FO%20%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC%2C%20Spring%20Boot%EB%8A%94%20%EC%95%88%EC%A0%95%EC%A0%81%EC%9D%B8%20%EC%9E%90%EB%B0%94%20%EC%9B%B9%20%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84%EC%9B%8C%ED%81%AC%2C%20Spring%20Security%EB%A1%9C%20%EA%B0%95%EB%A0%A5%ED%95%9C%20%EC%9D%B8%EC%A6%9D%2F%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80%20%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22whiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Baspect%3Dfixed%3Balign%3Dleft%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%22650%22%20y%3D%22560%22%20width%3D%22190%22%20height%3D%22190%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="560" width="190" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dj20kyIFJX9Evzzzmfgd-0" value="9. 로그 수집 서버&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;역할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- API / WAS / Web 로그 수집 및 시각화&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 사용자 행동, 관리자 작업 기록 관리&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;선정 이유&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- 장애 분석, 보안 감사 로그, 트래픽 추적에 필수&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="AhjasxdzfnwIepwqEJYf-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1730" y="560" width="230" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
